Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.99,0:00:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.01,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.53,0:01:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.09,0:01:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to see this place before I go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this is the town where the\Nentire Battle City tournament began.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta make sure we\Nhit every single spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.51,0:01:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting the complete tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.71,0:01:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for stop number\None, the Domino Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick together, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.15,0:01:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What time is there a gift shop here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Notice anything familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.53,0:01:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks like Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this the stone tablet\Neveryone was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.13,0:01:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where it all started.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My Pharaoh, I've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.13,0:01:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Ishizu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And I have uncovered many mysteries\Nabout you and these ancient carvings
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.97,0:01:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,using the magic of my Millennium necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Another Millennium item.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:02:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Like your millennium puzzle, this\Nnecklace affords me certain powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.57,0:02:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With it, I have gazed\N5,000 years into the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.19,0:02:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,to a time when evil sorcerers\Nthreatened to destroy the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.11,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,there was one king who possessed a magic\Npowerful enough to stop this evil threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.11,0:02:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And who was this king?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh who saved\Nthe world was you, Yami.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the time has come for\Nyou to rescue mankind once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.83,0:02:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,To rescue mankind from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know the world is in\Ndanger of being destroyed again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.85,0:02:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My Millennium Necklace also\Nshows me visions of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.17,0:02:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The events of the past\Nwill occur once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And that same great evil\Nwill return to threaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.11,0:02:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why Yugi joined\Nthe Battle City Tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.43,0:02:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Joey found out, he joined\Nto help Yugi save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where Joey fought his\Nfirst duel of the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,against that lame-o Esperoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.19,0:03:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my advice and stay\Naway from this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Esperoba.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He duels using ESP.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean he's psycho?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll mind-read the cards in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.35,0:03:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll know what move\Nyou'll make before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember everything about this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the hospital\Nafter my eye operation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and Tristan was giving\Nme the play-by-play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.17,0:03:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My big brothers never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to do\Nwhatever I can to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not be next to him, but can you help\Nme be with him in spirit, pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get back to the duel and cheer\Nthat brother of yours till he wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.37,0:03:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.53,0:04:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sacrifice your swords in the\NBlanchthor and I'll summon Jinzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is near, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.53,0:04:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine, Wheeler!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Jinso, attack his thousand\Ndragon with cyber energy shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.53,0:04:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that my dragon's gone,\Nhow long can I hold on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where I saw Joey dueling\Nfor the first time, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.53,0:04:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, Serenity, it\Nwas one of the worst days of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This may come as an unpleasant\Nsurprise, but like your friend Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.69,0:05:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya too is under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.18,0:05:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, leave her alone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's done nothing to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.81,0:05:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've turned your closest\Nfriends into your greatest enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're at my mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've attacked your life\Npoints yet again, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.87,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.15,0:05:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I wipe out the rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that anchor will drop, taking\Nyou with it right into the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.05,0:05:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, I can assure you that\Nyou'll never get away with your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore that fool, my servant, and use your\NMeteor of Destruction to finish him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you play that card,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Yugi will receive 1,000 points\Nworth of damage, destroying him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And his most prized\Npossessions will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do as I command and deliver\Nthe final strike against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.03,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:06:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to remember who you are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.77,0:06:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.35,0:06:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Destroy Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.53,0:06:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your feeble brain is no match for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.91,0:06:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So play Meteor of Destruction now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.05,0:06:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You belong to me. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And I command you to vanquish Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.37,0:06:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my best friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.91,0:06:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't destroy Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.41,0:06:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing your brother\Nhas such a strong head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,or he never would have\Nbroken Marek's mind control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not like I have to tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.19,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You were there to see it all yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.33,0:06:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.11,0:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Joey's bravery that gave me the\Nconfidence I needed to take my bandages off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, I never could have\Nimagined what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see Hang in there, Yugi
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.63,0:07:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be out of those chains in no time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.19,0:07:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.77,0:07:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to beat the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That anchor's going to\Ndrag both of them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.97,0:07:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I wouldn't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.15,0:07:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.79,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the insanity\Nwas over after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, was I wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.41,0:08:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It was off to the Battle\NCity Finals for more madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.05,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to board Kaiba Craft III for\Nthe start of the Battle City Finals!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.95,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.86,0:08:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware that you haven't played your\NEgyptian God card since you won it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.93,0:08:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's time for that to\Nend right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when the Battle\NCity Finals are all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the world's greatest duelist and\Nthe owner of all three Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.73,0:08:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,making my deck unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.61,0:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to experience\Na power like no other!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.43,0:08:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon the almighty\NSwiper the Sky Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.47,0:09:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I will summon my Egyptian god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,card show yourself obelisk the tormentor
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlock your powers from deep\Nwithin, so that together we may win!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.77,0:09:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Appear in this shadow\Ngame as I call your name!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.31,0:09:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Win the Dragon of Wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.51,0:09:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time now to end this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy, it's getting kinda chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.65,0:10:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, we should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.81,0:10:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's still plenty left to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll sacrifice Rocket Warrior in\Norder to summon my Jinzo to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.03,0:10:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, check out all these kids dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they all want to grow\Nup to be champion duelists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.99,0:10:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to Kaiba Corp, they can\Nget all the practice that they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now these virtual\Nduels can happen anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll place two cards face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cute to see kids dueling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.63,0:10:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.27,0:10:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You just reminded me of that kid\NNoah, and he was anything but cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.11,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Noah, you overpowered Kai\Nby using deceit and betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.91,0:11:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you used your virtual technology\Nto turn him and Mokuba into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.65,0:11:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that makes you a superior\Nduelist, you're sadly mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, we're all here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're all so confident\Nthat Yugi's going to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to put\Nyour fate in his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So with every turn that\NYugi fails to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.43,0:11:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,another of you will be turned to stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.83,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be frozen in time with\Na look of despair on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.99,0:11:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Yugi failed to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the end, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.43,0:11:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be left in the\Nmiddle of a circle of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,motionless statues that\Nwere once your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.07,0:11:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.41,0:11:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.95,0:11:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You insist on humiliating\Nyourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.69,0:11:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop until you're defeated, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.47,0:11:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.79,0:11:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It can revive any monster\Nyou sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.59,0:12:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,including Kaiba's Blue-Eyes White Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate this card, Polymerization.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to fuse my\NBlue-Eyes on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,with the two other\NBlue-Eyes cards in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.43,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, behold the power of my\NBlue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.03,0:12:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NQuick Attack Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets my dragon attack right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hino Kadosuchi is finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, you're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.65,0:12:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the next magic\Ncard in my hand, D-Fusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And separates my beast back\Ninto three separate dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.07,0:12:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,each with 3,000 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been exposed as the\Nfrightened child you truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.01,0:12:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragons, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.77,0:13:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This madness is finally over, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah was just lonely, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.35,0:13:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He had no friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he was just bitter because he\Nhad no one to play with for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to bring out my Summoned Skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.87,0:13:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, Noah\Nrealized he was wrong. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.21,0:13:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I got to know my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, does this mean you're not coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.23,0:13:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's something\NI still have to do, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't let you hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm keeping you trapped in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.25,0:13:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sound familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.19,0:13:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to release\Nme immediately, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.05,0:13:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to free your mind and make\Nsure you never harm anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Warning, virtual meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.21,0:14:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.39,0:14:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep me here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Noah got to feel what\Nit's like to have friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, nice duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.51,0:14:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice because I kicked your butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.79,0:14:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because I let you win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's play again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.41,0:14:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,These kids are kinda cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.31,0:14:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're only dueling for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When Yugi dueled in Battle\NCity, a lot more was at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.29,0:14:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're actually gonna go\Nahead with this duel up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget how many people have\Ngotten hurt in the tournament so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.59,0:14:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Yugi, enough's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.67,0:14:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the thought\Nof losing you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.87,0:14:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth all this suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This tournament's been\Nnothing but bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.43,0:15:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I walk away now, that means\Neveryone suffered for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, remember what we learned\Non our trip to the Domino Museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.43,0:15:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,About my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We found out that you were\Na pharaoh in ancient Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and that now you need\Nto save the world again
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,from some evil thingy like\Nyou did 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.17,0:15:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.08,0:15:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you now understand why backing out\Nof the tournament is not an option?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.60,0:15:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No buts, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.51,0:15:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I joined the Battle\NCity Tournament was to fulfill
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.61,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ashizu's prophecy and stop this\Ngreat evil from endangering mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.05,0:15:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And when Joey found out, he vowed to\Nhelp me, no matter how tough the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why I must press on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.85,0:15:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, not only would\NI be giving up on Joey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be giving up on the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.15,0:15:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too much at stake to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right here. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.15,0:16:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you can win this, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The last duel's about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek Ishtar will face Yugimoto, and the\Nwinner will receive the Battle City Crown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the fun begin now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.13,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another Shadow Game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.91,0:16:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You've witnessed several of my Shadow Games\Nbefore, but this one will be different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.73,0:16:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thrown in a few\Ntwists, especially for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet my next victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.65,0:16:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Lose the duel and Yugi\Ngoes to the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.17,0:16:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, this is about you\Nand me, so leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.01,0:16:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're forgetting my weaker half!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.25,0:16:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's involved in this conflict as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So if I lose, the shadows will take him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.23,0:16:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shadow Realm will claim an\Ninnocent soul no matter who wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.63,0:17:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Showing serenity around\Ntown brought back so many
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.63,0:17:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,memories about my friends in\Nthe Battle City tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.89,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everyone's going their separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's time to go. Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.63,0:17:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad that everything\Nturned out okay in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner of the Battle City\NChampionship crown is... Yugi Moto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm going to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.01,0:17:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.23,0:17:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And as the winner, you get to keep the\Nrarest card from your opponent's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.85,0:17:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, my rarest card.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And remember, you're going\Nto need this card, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.57,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.87,0:17:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We have all three of\Nthe Egyptian God Cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.75,0:18:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that they're in our deck,\Nwhat are we supposed to do with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How can we use these cards to unlock\Nthe hidden powers of the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.33,0:18:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We need more information.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Yugi has everything\Nhe needs to finish his journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.75,0:18:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll ever see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.99,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.15,0:18:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you went out of your way\Nto show me around the city today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.53,0:18:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to, and\Nit meant so much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.81,0:18:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it two o 'clock already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.37,0:18:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm totally late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.21,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you have something\Nimportant to do, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.47,0:18:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I didn't realize I was\Ngoing to mess up your plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.77,0:18:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you had told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would have\Ndragged you around town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.69,0:19:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not that late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Before long, Yugi might be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, who knows where\Nfate's gonna take him next?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.81,0:19:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.05,0:19:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a train to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.91,0:19:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.15,0:19:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're\Ngonna be so far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.29,0:19:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be close, Teya. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like Joey always tells me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He's connected to you guys with a special\Nbond of friendship that can never break.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.85,0:19:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey said that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he was a big softy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel like I'm one of you guys, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.73,0:19:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But you've always been one of us,\NSerenity, ever since we first met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we'll never be far apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.93,0:19:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see you later, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.65,0:20:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how far apart I am from my friends,\Nthey're always right here in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Yugi and I will always be\Nfriends, no matter what happens next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not ready for him to go away yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess all I can do is enjoy\Nthe time we have together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo, Yugi! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.49,0:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
